@GammaApp is a special company.

$100M+ ARR, $2M+ ARR per employee, profitable. Those numbers speak for themselves.

But what impresses me more is how @thisisgrantlee, @thatsjonsense, and @jamisonfox have tuned out the noise and focused relentlessly on building a product their users (me included!) genuinely love. Onwards!

In this economy, the smartest trade might just be shorting PowerPoint.

@gammaapp is an AI tool that actually makes something you can show to your boss without 3 hours of formatting trauma.

The decks hit harder than CPI prints.

We’re proud to lead Gamma’s Series B at a $2.1B valuation and back the team building the anti-PowerPoint.

In a post-AI world, there’s no reason we should still be using software introduced in 1987 to communicate ideas. Things that used to be hard are now easy, and slideware should take full advantage of what we can now automate.

@thisisgrantlee, @thatsjonsense, and @jamisonfox have built @GammaApp, an AI-powered storytelling platform that helps anyone go from idea to presentation, website, or social post in seconds. With 70M users and a new API that enables content generation at scale, Gamma is redefining how teams communicate.

@thisisgrantlee @sarahdingwang @a16z .@thisisgrantlee @GammaApp Congrats! Insane all the beautiful slides Gamma generates with one prompt.

Also insane how circa-1990 a single PowerPoint slide can look with a Copilot prompt.  

